{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-arith-real-relation.md","title":"带函数变量的算术关系","display":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-arith-real-relation","aliases":["20-df-arith-real-relation"],"display":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地带函数变量算术语义定义","depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]","[[20-df-pa]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-arith-real-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-arith-real-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arith-real-relation — 带函数变量的算术关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地带函数变量算术语义定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot f\">\\(\\dot f\\)</span> 是原扩展语言新增的固定一元函数标签，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{PA}\">\\(F_{PA}\\)</span>、变量及逻辑标签不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{PA,f}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{PA,f}\\)</span> 的下标 f 指该语法标签；量词中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 是解释该标签的全自然数函数，两者不混同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith\\text{-}real\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal L_{PA,f}:=(F_{PA}\\cup\\{\\dot f\\},\\varnothing,\na_{F,PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,1)\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\nI_f:=I_{PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,\\{((n),f(n)):n\\in\\omega\\})\\}\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_f:=(\\omega,I_f,\\varnothing)\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathscr A_{k,1}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA,f})\\\n[\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n((\\vec n,f)\\in R\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_f\\models\\theta[\\vec n])]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith\\text{-}real\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal L_{PA,f}:=(F_{PA}\\cup\\{\\dot f\\},\\varnothing,\na_{F,PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,1)\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\nI_f:=I_{PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,\\{((n),f(n)):n\\in\\omega\\})\\}\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_f:=(\\omega,I_f,\\varnothing)\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathscr A_{k,1}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA,f})\\\n[\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n((\\vec n,f)\\in R\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_f\\models\\theta[\\vec n])]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先固定语法语言，再让 f 只改变该新增符号的解释；被量化的公式不会随 f 换语言。标准算术解释直接来自 PA 的显式解释表，没有加入任意固定实参数。原 lightface 算术矩阵类及其接口保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：本地带函数变量算术语义定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot f","display":false},{"tex":"F_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{PA,f}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arith\\text{-}real\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal L_{PA,f}:=(F_{PA}\\cup\\{\\dot f\\},\\varnothing,\na_{F,PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,1)\\},\\varnothing),\\\\\nI_f:=I_{PA}\\cup\\{(\\dot f,\\{((n),f(n)):n\\in\\omega\\})\\}\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathfrak N_f:=(\\omega,I_f,\\varnothing)\\quad(f\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathscr A_{k,1}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_{PA,f})\\\n[\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<k\\}\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n((\\vec n,f)\\in R\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_f\\models\\theta[\\vec n])]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1961,"backlinks":[{"id":"0abc357ef7715d00","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith-real-relation]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-arith-real-relation]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-438","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-arith-real-relation]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-438","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-arith-real-relation]]"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2","d4a7833057f5a20e","4e01ee20e163d443"]}